            "count": 1,
            "detail": "`authoritativeDefinitions[]` points at an external business definition, lineage record, or schema document by URL. The URLs are recorded in `extras['odcs_authoritative_definitions']` and **never fetched** during import; a relative URL that names a member of the same imported file set is additionally recorded as resolved, but its content is not expanded into the canonical model.",
