          {
            "construct": "odcs.classification",
            "count": 1,
            "detail": "`classification` (`confidential`, `restricted`, …) and `criticalDataElement` are governance labels on a field. The canonical model has no classification vocabulary, so both are carried on the field in `extras` — which is what keeps a PII marker visible on the catalog detail view without pretending it is a validation constraint.",
            "locations": [
